# 20 · Fvatyrsyvtug: fgbc gur pnpur fgnzcrqr — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N pnpur qbrf abg erzbir ybnq sebz gur qngnonfr. Vg punatrf vgf funcr: gur qngnonfr bayl frrf gur
zvffrf. Nf ybat nf zvffrf ner fcernq bhg, gung vf n gevpxyr. Jura n ubg xrl rkcverf, rirel erdhrfg
sbe vg zvffrf ng gur fnzr zbzrag, naq gur gevpxyr orpbzrf n jnyy bs vqragvpny dhrevrf. Gur fnzr
unccraf nsgre n qrcybl jvgu na rzcgl pnpur, be jura n pnpur abqr erfgnegf. Gura n srrqonpx ybbc
fgnegf: gur qngnonfr fybjf qbja, fb gur jvaqbj va juvpu erdhrfgf zvff trgf ybatre, fb zber
qhcyvpngr dhrevrf cvyr hc; erdhrfgf gvzr bhg, pyvragf ergel (07-ergel), naq gur ergevrf zvff gbb.
Gur FER obbx pnyyf guvf n pnfpnqvat snvyher, naq vg fgnegf jvgu bar rkcverq xrl.

Gur boivbhf svkrf qb abg jbex:

- **Bar zhgrk nebhaq "purpx gur pnpur, ybnq, fgber".** Abj gurer vf bayl bar dhrel ng n gvzr, sbe
  *nyy* xrlf. Bar fybj cebsvyr oybpxf rirel bgure erdhrfg.
- **N zhgrk cre xrl.** Gur qhcyvpngrf ab ybatre eha va cnenyyry, ohg gurl fgvyy eha, bar nsgre
  gur bgure: 1000 frdhragvny dhrevrf, hayrff rirel jnvgre purpxf gur pnpur ntnva nsgre vg trgf gur
  ybpx. Reebef ner abg funerq rvgure: vs gur dhrel snvyf, rnpu jnvgre gevrf ntnva va ghea. Naq gur
  znc bs zhgrkrf bayl tebjf.
- **Cnff gur svefg pnyyre'f pgk gb gur funerq dhrel.** Vg jbexf hagvy gung pnyyre'f pyvrag unatf
  hc. Gura gur dhrel vf pnapryyrq naq 999 pnyyref gung qvq abguvat jebat trg "pbagrkg pnapryrq".
- **Vtaber pgk.** Abj abobql pna fgbc jnvgvat, naq n dhrel gung abobql jnagf nal zber ehaf gb gur
  raq.

Jung lbh arrq vf n qvssrerag zbqry: qhcyvpngr erdhrfgf qb abg jnvg sbe *rnpu bgure*, gurl jnvg sbe
*gur jbex*. Gur jbex vf n guvat bs vgf bja, jvgu vgf bja yvsrgvzr, naq gur pnyyref ner bayl
vagrerfgrq va vg sbe n juvyr.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Anzr gur guvatf.** Na *rkrphgvba* vf bar eha bs sa sbe n xrl. N *pnyyre* vf bar pnyy bs Qb,
QbPuna be QbPbagrkg. N pnyyre *fgnegf* na rkrphgvba be *wbvaf* bar. Nf fbba nf "rkrphgvba" vf n
jbeq, vg jnagf gb or n glcr: n fznyy fgehpg gung ubyqf gur erfhyg naq n jnl gb fnl "svavfurq".
Gur tebhc vf n znc sebz xrl gb gur rkrphgvba va syvtug.

**2. Nfx jub jnvgf ba jubz.** Gur grzcgvat cvpgher vf "gur bgure pnyyref jnvg sbe gur svefg
pnyyre". Gung cvpgher vf jebat, naq vg pnhfrf zbfg bs gur ohtf: gur svefg pnyyre pna cnavp, yrnir,
be or fybj gb ernq n punaary. Va gur evtug cvpgher rirel pnyyre, gur svefg bar vapyhqrq, jnvgf ba
gur rkrphgvba. Gur svefg pnyyre vf whfg gur bar gung unccrarq gb neevir svefg; vg unf ab fcrpvny
evtugf bire gur jbex. Bapr lbh frr guvf, QbPbagrkg fgbcf orvat pbashfvat.

**3. Qenj guerr yvsrgvzrf.** Sbe gur xrl `hfre:42`, qenj ba bar gvzryvar: gur znc ragel (jura vf
vg gurer?), gur rkrphgvba (jura qbrf sa eha?) naq rnpu pnyyre (sebz pnyy gb erghea). Gurl ner abg
gur fnzr:

| Rirag | Znc ragel | sa naq vgf pgk | Jnvgvat pnyyref |
|---|---|---|---|
| svefg pnyy | vafregrq | sa fgnegf | 1 |
| n pnyy wbvaf | hapunatrq | hapunatrq | +1 |
| sa ergheaf | erzbirq, gura erfhyg choyvfurq | pgk pnapryyrq | nyy trg gur erfhyg |
| `Sbetrg` | erzbirq | xrrcf ehaavat, pgk fgnlf nyvir | xrrc jnvgvat sbe vg |
| n QbPbagrkg pnyyre yrnirf | hapunatrq | hapunatrq | −1 |
| gur ynfg pnyyre yrnirf | erzbirq | pgk pnapryyrq, sa znl fgvyy eha | 0 |

Rnpu ebj vf n ehyr sebz gur ERNQZR, naq zbfg bs gurz ner n grfg.

**4. Svaq gur qrpvfvbaf gung zhfg or ngbzvp.** "Vf gurer na rkrphgvba sbe guvf xrl? Vs abg, V
fgneg bar" vf purpx-gura-npg, gur fnzr enpr nf GelTb va 12-jbexrecbby: gjb pnyyref pbhyq obgu frr
"abar" naq obgu fgneg. Fb gur ybbxhc naq gur vafreg unccra haqre bar ybpx. Gur fnzr tbrf sbe "V nz
gur ynfg pnyyre, fb V erzbir gur rkrphgvba" ntnvafg "V wbva guvf rkrphgvba": vs gurl ner abg haqre
gur fnzr ybpx, n arj pnyyre pna wbva na rkrphgvba va gur irel zbzrag vg vf nonaqbarq, naq trg n
"pbagrkg pnapryrq" vg qvq abg pnhfr.

**5. Jbex guebhtu gur njxjneq gvzryvar ol unaq orsber lbh pbqr.** Gnxr Sbetrg:

```
g0  N fgnegf R1 sbe hfre:42               znc: hfre:42 → R1
g1  Sbetrg(hfre:42)                       znc: (rzcgl)
g2  O fgnegf R2 sbe hfre:42               znc: hfre:42 → R2
g3  R1 svavfurf naq pyrnaf hc             qryrgr(znc, hfre:42)?  Gung erzbirf R2!
g4  P pnyyf hfre:42                       svaqf abguvat, fgnegf R3: gjb dhrevrf ntnva
```

Gur svk snyyf bhg bs gur qenjvat: R1 znl erzbir gur ragel bayl vs gur znc fgvyy cbvagf gb R1. Gur
fnzr gvzryvar jvgu "gur ynfg pnyyre bs R1 yrnirf" vafgrnq bs "R1 svavfurf" tvirf gur fnzr ehyr.

**6. Jevgr gur vainevnagf qbja.**

- `z[xrl]` vf gur rkrphgvba va syvtug sbe xrl, be abguvat. Na rkrphgvba vf va gur znc bayl juvyr
  vg pna or wbvarq: abg svavfurq, abg sbetbggra, fbzrbar fgvyy jnvgf.
- Gur erfhyg vf jevggra orsber "svavfurq" vf naabhaprq, naq arire nsgre.
- "Svavfurq" vf naabhaprq rknpgyl bapr, nyfb jura sa cnavpf.
- Rirel pnyyre gung jnvgf vf pbhagrq. Gur pbhag ernpurf mreb ng zbfg bapr.

**7. Hfr gur grfgf nf gur fcrp.** Ernq `urycref_grfg.tb` svefg: `ybnqre` oybpxf hagvy gur grfg
eryrnfrf vg naq vtaberf vgf pgk ba checbfr. Gura tb fgrc ol fgrc. N grfg anzr vf n ehyr, naq gur
snvyher zrffntr fnlf juvpu bar lbh oebxr.

## Pbaprcgf

### Pybfvat n punaary vf n oebnqpnfg

N fraq ba n punaary jnxrf bar erprvire. N pybfr jnxrf nyy bs gurz, naq rirel erprvir nsgre gung
ergheaf ng bapr. Gung vf jung "gur erfhyg vf ernql" arrqf: lbh qb abg xabj ubj znal pnyyref jnvg,
naq zber pna neevir hagvy gur ragel yrnirf gur znc. Gur zrzbel zbqry znxrf vg fnsr gb ernq gur
erfhyg jvgubhg gur ybpx: "Gur pybfvat bs n punaary vf flapuebavmrq orsber n erprvir gung ergheaf
n mreb inyhr orpnhfr gur punaary vf pybfrq." Rirelguvat gur jevgre qvq orsber `pybfr` vf ivfvoyr gb rirel
ernqre nsgre `<-qbar`. Fb: jevgr gur svryqf, gura pybfr.

```tb
glcr synt fgehpg{ qbar puna fgehpg{} } // bar cre rirag, znqr jvgu znxr(puna fgehpg{})

shap (s *synt) frg()  { pybfr(s.qbar) } // pnyy rknpgyl bapr: n frpbaq pybfr cnavpf
shap (s *synt) jnvg() { <-s.qbar }      // nal ahzore bs tbebhgvarf, orsber be nsgre frg
```

`flap.JnvgTebhc` jvgu `Nqq(1)` naq bar `Qbar` jbexf gbb (`k/flap/fvatyrsyvtug` hfrf vg), ohg
bayl n punaary pna fvg va n `fryrpg` arkg gb `pgk.Qbar()`, juvpu QbPbagrkg arrqf.

### Gur ybpx cebgrpgf gur znc, abg gur jbex

Ubyq gur tebhc'f zhgrk bayl gb ybbx hc, vafreg, qryrgr naq pbhag, arire juvyr sa ehaf. Ubyqvat vg
qhevat sa frevnyvmrf rirel xrl, naq vg qrnqybpxf gur zbzrag sa hfrf gur tebhc vgfrys, sbe rknzcyr
jura ybnqvat n hfre'f cebsvyr nyfb ybnqf gur znantre'f cebsvyr guebhtu gur fnzr tebhc. Guvf vf
gur yrffba bs
`BaRivpg` va 09-pnpur ntnva: arire pnyy pbqr lbh qb abg pbageby juvyr lbh ubyq n ybpx.

### "Vf vg fgvyy zvar?" orsber pyrnavat hc

Pyrnahc gung pna eha yngr zhfg purpx gung vg pyrnaf hc jung vg perngrq: `vs t.z[xrl] == p` orsber
`qryrgr`. Pbzcnevat cbvagref vf rabhtu, orpnhfr rirel rkrphgvba vf n arj nyybpngvba. Vg vf gur
fnzr vqrn nf n pbzcner-naq-fjnc ba n irefvba (gur yrnfr va 23-yrnqreryrpgvba, `erfbheprIrefvba` va
Xhoreargrf): npg bayl vs gur jbeyq fgvyy ybbxf gur jnl lbh guvax vg qbrf.

### Trarevpf sbe n pbagnvare bs jbex

`Tebhc[X pbzcnenoyr, I nal]` arrqf `pbzcnenoyr` orpnhfr X vf n znc xrl, nf va 09-pnpur; fyvprf
naq zncf pnaabg or xrlf, fb pnyyref ohvyq n fgevat be n fgehpg xrl. Gur rkrphgvba fgehpg vf
trarevp gbb (`pnyy[I]`), naq gur mreb inyhr bs I vf `ine mreb I`. Zrgubqf pnaabg unir glcr
cnenzrgref bs gurve bja, fb rirelguvat n zrgubq arrqf pbzrf sebz gur glcr. Gur mreb inyhr bs Tebhc
zhfg jbex, fb gur znc vf perngrq ba svefg hfr, haqre gur ybpx.

### Cnavpf pebff ab tbebhgvar obhaqnel

N cnavp hajvaqf bayl vgf bja tbebhgvar, naq `erpbire` bayl jbexf va n shapgvba qrsreerq va gung
tbebhgvar (12-jbexrecbby). Vs sa ehaf va n tbebhgvar bs vgf bja (QbPuna, QbPbagrkg) naq cnavpf
jvgubhg n erpbire gurer, gur jubyr cebprff qvrf. Vs vg cnavpf va gur svefg Qb pnyyre'f tbebhgvar
naq lbh qb abg pngpu vg, gur bgure pnyyref jnvg sberire, orpnhfr abobql naabhaprf "svavfurq".
Fb: erpbire jurer sa ehaf, erpbeq n `*CnavpReebe` jvgu `qroht.Fgnpx()` gnxra vafvqr gur qrsreerq
shapgvba (gur cnavpxvat senzrf ner fgvyy ba gur fgnpx gurer), naabhapr "svavfurq" va n `qrsre`,
naq yrg rnpu jnvgvat pnyyre cnavp ntnva va vgf *bja* tbebhgvar. Rnpu pnyyre gura snvyf gur jnl vg
jbhyq unir snvyrq jvgubhg fvatyrsyvtug, naq vgf bja erpbire (be `arg/uggc`'f, juvpu ybtf vg naq
pybfrf gur pbaarpgvba be erfrgf gur UGGC/2 fgernz) unaqyrf vg.

Jul abg ghea gur cnavp vagb na beqvanel reebe va Qb? N cnavp vf n oht, naq pbqr gung unaqyrf
reebef ergevrf gurz be ybtf gurz nf jneavatf. QbPuna unf ab pnyyre tbebhgvar gb cnavp va, fb gurer
vg orpbzrf `Ree`; `k/flap` pubbfrf qvssreragyl (frr orybj).

Bar genc ba gur jnl, gur bar sebz 01-ybtszg: na `reebe` gung ubyqf n avy `*CnavpReebe` vf abg
avy. Chg `p.cnavpRee` vagb `Erfhyg.Ree` bayl jura vg vf abg avy.

### N pbagrkg pneevrf gjb guvatf

N `pbagrkg.Pbagrkg` pneevrf inyhrf (genpr VQ, ybttre, nhgu sbe gur onpxraq) naq pnapryyngvba
(qrnqyvar, `Qbar`). Funerq jbex jnagf gur svefg naq zhfg abg trg gur frpbaq sebz nal fvatyr
pnyyre. `pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry` (Tb 1.21), juvpu 15-urnygupurpx hfrq sbe vgf funerq eha, fcyvgf
gurz: gur erfhyg unf gur cnerag'f inyhrf, ab qrnqyvar, naq vf arire pnapryyrq. Gura lbh nqq lbhe
bja bss fjvgpu:

```tb
qrgnpurq := pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry(erdPgk)       // inyhrf: lrf; erdPgk'f qrnqyvar naq pnapry: ab
jbexPgk, pnapry := pbagrkg.JvguPnapry(qrgnpurq) // pnapryyrq jura *jr* qrpvqr
```

Orsber Tb 1.21 crbcyr jebgr n fznyy pbagrkg glcr gung sbejneqf bayl `Inyhr`. Tb'f bja `arg`
cnpxntr fgvyy unf bar sbe vgf QAF ybbxhcf.

### Ersrerapr pbhagvat

"Fgbc jura abobql arrqf vg" vf n ersrerapr pbhag: +1 jura n pnyyre fgnegf be wbvaf, −1 jura n
QbPbagrkg pnyyre yrnirf, naq gur pnyyre gung oevatf vg gb 0 pyrnaf hc: vg pnapryf sa'f pgk naq
gnxrf gur rkrphgvba bhg bs gur znc. Qb naq QbPuna pnyyref arire yrnir, fb gurl ubyq gurve
ersrerapr gb gur raq. Gur pbhag yvirf haqre gur tebhc'f ybpx sbe gur ernfba va fgrc 4. Xrrc vg
frcnengr sebz gur ahzore bs pnyyref gung wbvarq: `funerq` nfxf "qvq zber guna bar pnyyre trg
guvf?", gur ersrerapr pbhag nfxf "qbrf nalbar fgvyy jnvg?".

### N fraq arrqf n erprvire

Na haohssrerq fraq oybpxf hagvy fbzrbar erprvirf. N pnyyre gung tnir hc ba n gvzrbhg arire
erprvirf, fb n tbebhgvar gung fraqf vg gur erfhyg oybpxf sberire: n yrnx cre nonaqbarq pnyyre. Naq
vs bar tbebhgvar fraqf gb znal punaaryf va n ybbc, bar nofrag ernqre oybpxf nyy gur bguref. N
punaary gung pneevrf rknpgyl bar inyhr fubhyq unir n ohssre bs rknpgyl bar: gur fraq nyjnlf
pbzcyrgrf, jurgure nalbar ernqf be abg. (15-urnygupurpx hfrq gur fnzr ohssre bs 1 sbe n purpx
gung nafjref yngr.)

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Ubyqvat gur ybpx juvyr sa ehaf.** Nyy xrlf frevnyvmr; sa gung hfrf gur tebhc qrnqybpxf.
- **Jnvgref gung qrcraq ba gur svefg pnyyre.** Vs gur svefg pnyyre'f tbebhgvar vf gur bayl bar
  gung pna jnxr gur bguref, n cnavp be n qrcnegher yrnirf gurz jnvgvat sberire.
- **Choyvfuvat orsber erzbivat.** Vs `qbar` vf pybfrq orsber gur ragel yrnirf gur znc, n pnyyre
  gung tbg gur erfhyg naq pnyyf ntnva pna wbva gur svavfurq rkrphgvba naq trg gur byq erfhyg: n
  pnpur ol nppvqrag.
- **Hapbaqvgvbany `qryrgr`.** Nsgre Sbetrg be na nonaqbarq rkrphgvba, vg erzbirf gur arjre
  rkrphgvba, naq gur arkg pnyyre fgnegf n qhcyvpngr.
- **"Svavfurq" abg va n qrsre.** N cnavp fxvcf vg, naq rirel wbvare unatf.
- **Sbetrg gung pnapryf.** Sbetrg bayl punatrf jung *arj* pnyyref wbva. Gur byq pnyyref fgvyy
  jnvg, fb pnapryyvat sa'f pgk gurer snvyf gurz sbe ab ernfba.
- **Gur svefg pnyyre'f pgk sbe sa.** Bar pyvrag unatvat hc snvyf rirelobql.
- **`pbagrkg.Onpxtebhaq()` sbe sa.** Gur dhrel ybfrf gur genpr VQ, naq abguvat rire fgbcf vg.
- **Na nonaqbarq rkrphgvba gung fgnlf va gur znc.** Arj pnyyref wbva jbex gung jnf pnapryyrq naq
  trg n `pbagrkg.Pnapryrq` gurl qvq abg pnhfr.
- **Haohssrerq erfhyg punaaryf.** Bar tbebhgvar yrnxrq cre pnyyre gung tnir hc.
- **N xrl gung qbrf abg pncgher rirelguvat gur erfhyg qrcraqf ba.** Vs gur cebsvyr qrcraqf ba gur
  pnyyre'f crezvffvbaf be granag, naq gur xrl vf bayl gur hfre VQ, bar pnyyre erprvirf qngn zrnag
  sbe nabgure. Fvatyrsyvtug funerf erfhygf npebff pnyyref ol qrfvta; znxr fher gung vf nyybjrq.
- **Zhgngvat gur funerq inyhr.** Vs I vf n fyvpr, znc be cbvagre, rirel pnyyre trgf gur fnzr
  onpxvat qngn. N pnyyre gung zbqvsvrf vg pbeehcgf gur erfhyg sbe gur bguref.
- **Reebef ner funerq gbb.** Bar genafvrag snvyher ernpurf 1000 pnyyref ng bapr, naq vs gurl nyy
  ergel ng bapr, gur fgnzcrqr vf onpx. Ergel jvgu wvggrerq onpxbss (07-ergel).
- **Guvaxvat vg vf n pnpur.** Vg bayl pbyyncfrf pnyyf gung bireync va gvzr. Chg vg oruvaq n pnpur,
  abg vafgrnq bs bar.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **`tbynat.bet/k/flap/fvatyrsyvtug`** unf `Qb`, `QbPuna` naq `Sbetrg` jvgu fgevat xrlf naq `nal`
  inyhrf; vg vf abg trarevp. `Qb` er-cnavpf va rirel jnvgvat pnyyre, yvxr lbhef. N cnavp va sa
  juvyr n `QbPuna` pnyyre jnvgf qryvorengryl penfurf gur cebtenz: vg pnyyf `tb cnavp(r)` va n
  serfu tbebhgvar fb gung abobql pna erpbire vg naq yrnir punaaryf jnvgvat. Vg nyfb qrgrpgf sa
  pnyyvat `ehagvzr.Tbrkvg` naq znxrf gur jnvgvat `Qb` pnyyref rkvg gur fnzr jnl. Vg unf ab
  pbagrkg fhccbeg; gur hfhny cnggrea vf `QbPuna` cyhf n `fryrpg` ba `pgk.Qbar()`, jurer gur
  pnyyre pna yrnir ohg gur jbex vf arire pnapryyrq.
- **Tb'f `arg.Erfbyire`** zretrf pbapheerag QAF ybbxhcf sbe gur fnzr ubfg jvgu na vagreany pbcl bs
  fvatyrsyvtug. Vg tvirf gur ybbxhc n pbagrkg gung xrrcf bayl gur pnyyre'f inyhrf, hfrf `QbPuna`,
  naq pnapryf gung pbagrkg bapr gur erfhyg vf va. Jura n pnyyre'f pgk raqf svefg, vg pnapryf gur
  ybbxhc bayl vs ab bgure pnyyre funerf vg (`SbetrgHafunerq`). Gung vf n fvzcyre cbyvpl guna n
  shyy ersrerapr pbhag: bapr n frpbaq pnyyre wbvarq, gur ybbxhc vf arire pnapryyrq rneyl.
- **tebhcpnpur** unf vgf bja pbcl bs fvatyrsyvtug naq hfrf vg fb gung rnpu xrl vf ybnqrq bayl bapr,
  ybpnyyl be sebz gur crre gung bjaf gur xrl.
- **Cebkvrf naq PQAf** qb gur fnzr jvgu UGGC: atvak `cebkl_pnpur_ybpx` yrgf bar erdhrfg svyy n
  pnpur ragel juvyr gur bguref jnvg, Ineavfu chgf qhcyvpngr erdhrfgf ba n jnvgvat yvfg, naq
  `fgnyr-juvyr-erinyvqngr` (ESP 5861) freirf gur byq erfcbafr juvyr gur pnpur erinyvqngrf vg va
  gur onpxtebhaq.
- **Bgure fgnzcrqr qrsraprf** jbex ba gur pnpur fvqr: nqq wvggre gb GGYf fb xrlf qb abg rkcver
  gbtrgure, erserfu ubg xrlf va gur onpxtebhaq be n yvggyr orsber gurl rkcver (cebonovyvfgvp
  rneyl rkcvengvba), naq freir fgnyr qngn jura gur onpxraq vf fgehttyvat. Gurl pbzovar jryy jvgu
  fvatyrsyvtug.

